Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.10,Fala,,0,0,0,,Se você tem
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.10,0:00:02.20,Fala,,0,0,0,,{\c&H4EC1F2&}Nvidia{\c&HFFFFFF&} na sua
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.20,0:00:02.96,Fala,,0,0,0,,carteira
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.96,0:00:03.82,Fala,,0,0,0,,então preste muita
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.82,0:00:04.30,Fala,,0,0,0,,atenção
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.30,0:00:04.54,Fala,,0,0,0,,Fala
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.54,0:00:04.88,Fala,,0,0,0,,galera
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.88,0:00:05.66,Fala,,0,0,0,,aqui é o Heitor
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.66,0:00:07.19,Fala,,0,0,0,,do Termômetro de Crise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.19,0:00:08.03,Fala,,0,0,0,,No último domingo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.03,0:00:08.63,Fala,,0,0,0,,o conselho abriu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.63,0:00:09.35,Fala,,0,0,0,,uma investigação
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.35,0:00:11.19,Fala,,0,0,0,,independente sobre {\c&H4EC1F2&}Jensen Huang{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.19,0:00:12.80,Fala,,0,0,0,,Reportagem é do {\c&H4EC1F2&}New York Times{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:13.76,Fala,,0,0,0,,com fontes anônimas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.76,0:00:14.54,Fala,,0,0,0,,O conselho diz
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.54,0:00:15.40,Fala,,0,0,0,,não ter motivo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.40,0:00:16.52,Fala,,0,0,0,,para crer que vazaram
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.52,0:00:17.27,Fala,,0,0,0,,segredos
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.27,0:00:18.19,Fala,,0,0,0,,Segundo a {\c&H4EC1F2&}Bloomberg{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.19,0:00:19.09,Fala,,0,0,0,,a ação já caía
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.09,0:00:20.47,Fala,,0,0,0,,{\c&H4EC1F2&}5%{\c&HFFFFFF&} antes mesmo da
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.47,0:00:21.03,Fala,,0,0,0,,abertura
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.03,0:00:22.02,Fala,,0,0,0,,Pela mesma conta
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.02,0:00:24.04,Fala,,0,0,0,,uns {\c&H4EC1F2&}225{\c&HFFFFFF&} bilhões
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.04,0:00:24.84,Fala,,0,0,0,,de dólares a menos
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.84,0:00:25.33,Fala,,0,0,0,,do valor
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.33,0:00:26.11,Fala,,0,0,0,,Quem tem {\c&H4EC1F2&}Nvidia{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.11,0:00:26.81,Fala,,0,0,0,,tem um recibo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.81,0:00:28.23,Fala,,0,0,0,,em reais da ação
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.23,0:00:28.84,Fala,,0,0,0,,americana
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.84,0:00:29.68,Fala,,0,0,0,,Tipo fatura com dois
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.68,0:00:29.98,Fala,,0,0,0,,itens
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.98,0:00:30.60,Fala,,0,0,0,,a ação lá
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.60,0:00:31.63,Fala,,0,0,0,,fora e o dólar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.63,0:00:32.61,Fala,,0,0,0,,Ainda não se sabe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.61,0:00:33.67,Fala,,0,0,0,,nem o prazo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.67,0:00:34.52,Fala,,0,0,0,,nem o resultado
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.52,0:00:36.09,Fala,,0,0,0,,A investigação mal começou
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.09,0:00:36.97,Fala,,0,0,0,,mas fica tranquilo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.97,0:00:37.61,Fala,,0,0,0,,sem {\c&H4EC1F2&}pânico{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.61,0:00:38.37,Fala,,0,0,0,,Confira o que você
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.37,0:00:39.09,Fala,,0,0,0,,tem e acompanha
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.09,0:00:39.83,Fala,,0,0,0,,a reunião do dia
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.83,0:00:41.07,Fala,,0,0,0,,{\c&H4EC1F2&}18{\c&HFFFFFF&} de novembro
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.07,0:00:42.40,Fala,,0,0,0,,Isso não é recomendação
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.40,0:00:43.41,Fala,,0,0,0,,é o termômetro
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.41,0:00:43.85,Fala,,0,0,0,,E o grupo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.85,0:00:44.60,Fala,,0,0,0,,do nosso WhatsApp
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.60,0:00:45.35,Fala,,0,0,0,,está com o link
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.35,0:00:45.73,Fala,,0,0,0,,na bio
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.73,0:00:46.51,Fala,,0,0,0,,é só acessar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.51,0:00:47.29,Fala,,0,0,0,,e entrar para saber
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.29,0:00:48.69,Fala,,0,0,0,,as novidades do mercado
